P2. The policy selects the algebra
==================================

Exhaustive over the whole domain at each width. No sampling.

--- declared width W = 3 (8 values) ---
  policy = wrap
      a+b == b+a               HOLDS everywhere
      (a+b)+c == a+(b+c)       HOLDS everywhere
      (a*b)*c == a*(b*c)       HOLDS everywhere
      a*(b+c) == a*b + a*c     HOLDS everywhere
      a+0 == a                 HOLDS everywhere
  policy = saturate
      a+b == b+a               HOLDS everywhere
      (a+b)+c == a+(b+c)       HOLDS everywhere
      (a*b)*c == a*(b*c)       HOLDS everywhere
      a*(b+c) == a*b + a*c     HOLDS everywhere
      a+0 == a                 HOLDS everywhere
  policy = exact
      a+b == b+a               HOLDS everywhere
      (a+b)+c == a+(b+c)       HOLDS everywhere
      (a*b)*c == a*(b*c)       HOLDS everywhere
      a*(b+c) == a*b + a*c     HOLDS everywhere
      a+0 == a                 HOLDS everywhere

